    "description": "<p>The excellence of the Lawgivers helps others find greatness of spirit and strength of will. This Charm expands the utility of Will-Bolstering Method, enabling the Solar to tap her own Virtue channels to restore another's corresponding channels, or do so as a source of Willpower points. The Lawgiver can consume her own drained channels for one Willpower point each to donate to others or restore their Virtue channels. The character can mix-and-match, donating Willpower and channels with the same action, though the Solar always has the option of tapping another Virtue if one pool runs dry before the transfer is complete.</p>",
